[27.827312, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  Get to finished work\u001b[24Gsooner\u001b[31Gwith\u001b[36GOpus\u001b[41G5.5.\u001b[46GSwitch\u001b[53Ganytime\u001b[61Gwith\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;105m/model\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;248m❯ \u001b[38;5;16mFinance says our money rounding is wrong: div_cents() in \u001b[39m           \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mapp/money.py drops fractions of a cent, but amounts must round half\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mup (for\u001b[11Gexample,\u001b[20G7% tax \u001b[28Gn 1050\u001b[35Gcents must be 74 cents, not 73). \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btests/t\u001b[11Gst_money.py pins the\u001b[32Grequir\u001b[39Gd behaviour; you can\u001b[61Gun it \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16mwith \u001b[38;5;105mpython3 -m pytest tests/test_money.py\u001b[38;5;16m. Fix it and tell\u001b[63Gme when\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit i\u001b[8G done. Do not commit; do not push.\u001b[39m                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[39m I'll fix the rounding issue in the \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m function. Let me\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfirst\u001b[9Gcheck\u001b[15Gthe\u001b[19Gcurrent\u001b[27Gimplementation\u001b[42Gand\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gtests.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow let me check\u001b[20Gthe\u001b[24Gtax_cents\u001b[34Gfunction\u001b[43Gto\u001b[46Gunderstand\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gcontext:\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;241mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mLet me run the tests to see the current\u001b[43Gfailures:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11G\u001b[1m1\u001b[13G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[19Gcommand…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38